Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libc6, ca-certificates
Recommends: docker.io, docker-compose-v2
Replaces: forge
Provides: forge
Description: Go CLI for generating, managing, analyzing and diagnosing backend APIs
 ForgeKit is a developer CLI written in Go that helps you bootstrap backend REST APIs
 without manually creating the same project structure, configuration, database integration,
 Docker files, migrations, and tests every time.
 .
 Build production-ready REST APIs with hexagonal architecture.
 Scaffolds projects with PostgreSQL, Docker, migrations, tests.
 Provides: forge add, forge remove, forge doctor, forge analyze, forge check, forge inspect.